    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Point-and-Click Adventure Game to experience the feeling from the 80's and 90's | Tech-Noir | Pixel Art and Retro Style | Interactive visual novel</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Step into Warden\u2019s shoes, solve puzzles, collect items, discover new places, talk to quirky characters, and uncover your destiny - and that of the universe - through conversations and unique moments in a mysterious story.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The capital melts away in the dying heat of dusk. At the heart of the boundless metropolis, a mysterious building wrapped in dark secrets rises in silence. Through the fragile fabric of space-time, its story begins to unfold - a tale where past, present, and future collide.</i></p>",
